<h2 id="运行-UEFI-Shell"><a href="#运行-UEFI-Shell" class="headerlink" title="运行 UEFI Shell"></a>运行 UEFI Shell</h2><p>初始化仓库</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ git clone https://github.com/YatSenOS/YatSenOS-Tutorial-Volume-2</span><br><span class="line">$ cd /path/to/your/workdir</span><br><span class="line">$ git init</span><br><span class="line">$ git add .</span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -m &quot;init&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="使用-QEMU-启动-UEFI-Shell"><a href="#使用-QEMU-启动-UEFI-Shell" class="headerlink" title="使用 QEMU 启动 UEFI Shell"></a>使用 QEMU 启动 UEFI Shell</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">qemu-system-x86_64 -bios ./assets/OVMF.fd -net none -nographic</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<img src="/articles/YSOS_0/1739175196536.png" class="" width="1739175196536">

<p>图中包括了：</p>
<ol>
<li><p>启动命令：</p>
<ul>
